title: Infoblox: Global DHCP configuration
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports the tenant wide DHCP configuration, including whether dynamic DNS
 updates are enabled and any globally configured utilisation thresholds.

 This check reports configuration rather than health and is always {OK}. It
 exists so that a change to a global setting is visible in the service
 history.

discovery:
 One service is created on the tenant host when a global DHCP configuration
 is present.
